### How the current system works, per this spec

Per the spec, agents/measure-orchestrator.md holds nine subagent rules: one "*" deny followed by eight allows (measure-*, coder, www-publisher, copywriter, fact-gate-checker, thai-writer, print-proof-auditor, change-quality-reviewer). PR #39 added the www-publisher allow row. The S2 check in tests/spec_review_gate/test_s2_role_docs.sh still pins the old eight pairs and omits www-publisher, so main fails that one check with "the subagent rules differ from the eight pairs". No other copy of the rule text exists in the repo and no other file changes in this track.

